.TH HOLYPKG 8 "September 2026" "Holy" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
holypkg \- Holy package tooling (configuration checker prototype)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B holypkg config check FILE
.br
.B holypkg info local:FILE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks syntax, includes, sections and duplicate scalar keys of a configuration
file without changing the system. No package installation, import, fetch,
resolution or indexing command is available yet. This executable is independent
of the separate owenewans/holypkg project.
.PP
The info command reads an LZ4-frame-compressed tar archive and prints the seven
required fields from HOLY/meta. It reads archive data without extracting or
executing it. It checks for repeated metadata and unsupported format versions.
It prints the SHA-256 digest of the input archive.
It does not validate the payload manifest, hashes, signatures or installability.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 indicates a valid file under the implemented checks; 2 indicates invalid
arguments or invalid configuration. Diagnostics go to standard error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR holy.conf (5)
